          "value": "<p>One creature within 12 squares meets its coin-pupiled eye and rolls vs Resolve (DC 14). Fail: Charmed and Staggered — captivated by a vision of its greatest desire, hanging just out of reach. Repeat the check at the end of each of its turns. On a success, immune to any Scavenger's Gaze for a day.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
